Create eight separate large cleanly silhouetted polished 3D game icons that match the silver, emerald, ebony art direction of the approved Malfoy Manor game. All icons have matching scale, quality, light direction and refinement, visible at small size. Keep each entire object inside its own tile with generous transparent padding, no overlap between cells, no labels, no grid lines, no numbers.
Exact order left to right, top row then bottom row:
1 emerald green potion in an ornate silver flask;
2 blackened silver serpent signet ring with a green gem;
3 closed charcoal-green spellbook with a silver snake clasp;
4 intricate antique silver key;
5 luminous faceted emerald gemstone;
6 elegant curved silver feather with a tiny emerald near its quill;
7 miniature dark wooden open Vanishing Cabinet with restrained emerald portal inside;
8 ornate silver family crest shield, emerald central gem, symmetrical heraldic snakes, no letters.
Materials: beautiful stylized 3D silver metal, leather, cut crystal, glass; restrained magic, no huge glows. All objects fully visible and well separated. Actual transparent alpha around each icon. No opaque background, no floor, no shadows outside the objects, no checkerboard, no text, no faces, no people, no watermark, no em dash character.
